{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primal Traveler - Supporter Pack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865720/extras/dfca0dd181a03e4e02ff0f13ee5c89eb.avif?t=1755012587\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the untamed spirit of the Ancient Era. The Primal Traveler pack invites you to walk among the echoes of a forgotten past, where weapons were forged with bone and stone, where beasts were both companions and guides, and primal magic surged through every feather, claw, and rune.<br><br><i>This pack contains exclusive <strong>cosmetic-only items</strong> that do not affect gameplay or power.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Pack Contains:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Backsloth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A loyal tree-dweller of eras long past, this clever sloth clings affectionately to your shoulders, its tiny backpack bouncing as you move. Whether scaling ruins or carving through timelines, your back is now spoken for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865720/extras/291a8e0c5c0fcd02f2680935153adb3b.avif?t=1755012587\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Hatchet</strong> <i>(1H Axe Cosmetic)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forged from cracked bone and chipped obsidian, bound in sinew and sacred feathers, this axe bears the marks of ancient runes that hum with forgotten strength. A true tool of survival\u2014and ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865720/extras/9f567a878926b4e2955ecfea48880a68.avif?t=1755012587\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Carrion Scepter</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafted in the image of a deathwatch crow, this scepter channels the dark wisdom of the skies. Its masked beak and blood-lit wings whisper warnings to those who draw too near, and power to those who listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865720/extras/4b2062967aaa67db8a1f2bb27a41e36c.avif?t=1755012587\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nigel, the LE Toucan</strong> <i>(Companion Pet)</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp of wit and sharper of beak, Nigel is no ordinary toucan. With a scroll slung proudly around his neck and a straw hat shading his thoughts, he\u2019s flown across timelines to bring an important message: <strong>LE Toucan has arrived.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<i>And yes\u2014he\u2019s for Last Epoch.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865720/extras/29f929a382569b12d248ff2e6e24c0be.avif?t=1755012587\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Primal Traveler Forum Badge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were here for Season 3, and your journey is a part of your story. Showcase your travels with the Primal Traveler Forum Badge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865720/extras/5a59824fa88cc5c522bd2465296d0207.avif?t=1755012587\" width=1600 height=291 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865720?t=1755012587","background_raw":"https://store.akama